{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01961","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 倦寝听晨鸡 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 倦寝听晨鸡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去去边城骑，愁眠掩夜闺。\n披衣窥落月，拭泪待鸣鸡。\n不愤连年别，那堪长夜嗁。\n功成应自恨，早晚发辽西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01961.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01961","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}